OL,3,GNEWSAResidents fear having to leave due
OL,4,Ato sinking homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents of a neighbourhood in Surrey
OL,7,Fwhere properties have been sinking into
OL,8,Fthe ground say they fear they will have
OL,9,Fto leave their homes.
OL,11,FGuildford Borough Council is consulting
OL,12,Fon "opportunities for future
OL,13,Fimprovements" to the the Westborough
OL,14,Fand Park Barn area.
OL,16,FSeveral council-owned houses in the
OL,17,Fareas, some of which have already been
OL,18,Fdemolished, had been left empty due to
OL,19,Fsubsidence problems.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
